{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "agilepilot-api-v1",
    "name": "AgilePilot API",
    "description": "AgilePilot backend API collection.\n\n## Flow\n1. Seed superAdmin (`npm run seed`)\n2. superAdmin creates **admin user only** → OTP emailed\n3. **Verify email** with OTP before login\n4. Admin logs in and **creates organization**\n5. Admin creates PM / teamMember users (each needs OTP verification)\n6. Admin creates project and assigns PM\n7. Admin adds team members and promotes team lead\n\n## Email OTP\nNew users created via `POST /api/users` must verify email before login.\nSet `DEV_EXPOSE_OTP=true` on the server to return `devOtp` in the create-user response (testing only).\nWithout SMTP, OTP is logged to the server console.\n\n## Auth\nProtected routes use `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`.\nLogin requests auto-save `token`, `userId`, and `organizationId`.\n\n## Response format\n**Success:** `{ \"status\": \"success\", \"message\": \"...\", \"data\": { ... } }`\n**Error:** `{ \"status\": \"error\", \"message\": \"...\", \"error\": ... }`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://agilepilot-backend.vercel.app" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "organizationId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "projectId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "pmUserId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "teamMemberUserId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "milestoneId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "taskId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "expenseId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "reportId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "emailOtp", "value": "" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Recommended Flow",
      "description": "Run these in order for a full smoke test.",
